\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 (100.000 th\'f9ng x 25%  x  78 ng\'e0y) + (50.000 th\'f9ng x 35%  x 78 ng\'e0y)= 3.315.000 th\'f9ng
\par 1.2 \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean v\'e0 ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f thu n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean:
\par a- \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean:
\par C\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu N\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i l\'e0 \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean, t\'fd\'f5ng \u7913\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi t\u7927\'3f l\u7879\'3f tham gia c\u7911\'3fa m\u7895\'3fi nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3f
u t\u7841\'3fi H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par b- Ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f thu n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean:
\par Thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7841\'3fm n\u7897\'3fp h\'e0ng th\'e1ng v\'e0 quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n h\'e0ng qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'fd (qu\'fd theo ng\'e0y d}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'fd\'f5ng l\u7883\'3fch) theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par b1- T\u7841\'3fm n\u7897\'3fp h\'e0ng th\'e1ng:
\par S\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean t\u7841\'3fm n\u7897\'3fp h\'e0ng th\'e1ng c\u7911\'3fa m\u7895\'3fi nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i b\u7857\'3fng 20% gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f ho\'e1 \'f0\'f5n m\u7895\'3fi chuy\u7871\'3fn h\'e0ng c
\u7911\'3fa nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chia trong th\'e1ng (ho\u7863\'3fc 20% gi\'e1 th\u7883\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng trong tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0o\u7841\'3ft d\u7847\'3fu th\'f4
 theo c\'e1c c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f kh\'e1c).
\par - Ch\u7853\'3fm nh\u7845\'3ft sau 5 ng\'e0y \'f0\u7847\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa m\u7895\'3fi th\'e1ng, c\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp xong s\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean t\u7841\'3fm n\u7897\'3fp c
\u7911\'3fa th\'e1ng tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 g\u7917\'3fi cho c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f b\u7843\'3fn k\'ea khai thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean (theo m\u7851\'3fu s\u7889\'3f 1 \'f0\'ednh k\'e8m) k\'e8m theo b\u7843\'3fn sao gi\u7845\'3fy n\u7897\'3fp ti
\u7873\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean.
\par Qu\'e1 th\u7901\'3fi h\u7841\'3fn n\'eau tr\'ean, n\u7871\'3fu c\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i ch\'fda g\u7917\'3fi b\u7843\'3fn k\'ea khai thu\u7871\'3f t\'e0i nguy\'ean cho c\'e1c c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f th}{\rtlch\fcs1 
