\f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'f2ng 3 ng\'e0y, k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f khi nh\u7853\'3fn }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o, c\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847
\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp \'f0\u7911\'3f s\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f ghi t\u7841\'3fi th\'f4ng b\'e1o n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f c\u7911\'3fa c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f v\'e0o Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc do c\'f5
