\'3fc ngo\'e0i; n\u7871\'3fu s\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f t\u7841\'3fm n\u7897\'3fp h\'e0ng th\'e1ng \'edt h\'f5n s\u7889\'3f thu\u7871\'3f ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp c\u7911\'3fa qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
