\u7907\'3fc th\'f4ng b\'e1o quy\u7871\'3ft to\'e1n thu\u7871\'3f qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'fd,  nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
