\par 2) Thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc:
\par 2.1 \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f v\'e0 ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc:
\par - M\u7895\'3fi c\'f4ng ty t\u7841\'3fo th\'e0nh nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i \'f0\u7873\'3fu l\'e0 \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc.
\par - L\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa m\u7895\'3fi nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i thu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\u7915\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng d\u7847\'3fu kh\'ed v\'e0 l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc ph\u7909\'3f (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3) l
\'e0 \'f0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc.
\par 2.2 T\'ednh thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc: Thu\u7871\'3f l\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc = L\u7907\'3fi t\u7913\'3fc ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f  x  Thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft
