nh theo c\'e1c nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng v\u7873\'3f vi\u7879\'3fc x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh gi\'e1 th\u7883\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng cho c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp n\'e0y. Trong khi ch
