\par 4) Thu\u7871\'3f doanh thu
\par B\'ean tham gia n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i v\'e0 nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i ph\u7843\'3fi n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f doanh thu trong c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp sau:
\par -  B\'e1n d\u7847\'3fu t\u7841\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam kh\'f4ng theo y\'eau c\u7847\'3fu c\u7911\'3fa th\u7883\'3f tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng trong n\'fd\u7899\'3fc nh\'fd quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 15 c\u7911\'3fa H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891
\'3fng.
\par - B\'e1n t\u7841\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, h\'e0ng ho\'e1, cung c\u7845\'3fp c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f, cho thu\'ea t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn . . . kh\'f4ng thu\u7897\'3fn ph\u7841\'3fm vi c\'e1c ho
\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng d\u7847\'3fu kh\'ed quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng.
\par Trong c\'e1c tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp tr\'ean, vi\u7879\'3fc khai b\'e1o n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f, m\u7913\'3fc thu\u7871\'3f su\u7845\'3ft, . . . \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'e1p d\u7909\'3fng theo c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Lu\u7853\'3f
t thu\u7871\'3f doanh thu v\'e0 c\'e1c v\'e3n b\u7843\'3fn h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn Lu\u7853\'3ft hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh.
\par 5) Thu\u7871\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu - Thu\u7871\'3f nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu
\par Nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f, h\'e0ng h\'f3a ph\u7909\'3fc v
\u7909\'3f cho c\'e1c ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng d\u7847\'3fu kh\'ed; \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7849\'3fu \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi d\u7847\'3fu kh\'ed  v\'e0 c\'e1c v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883
\'3f n\'eau tr\'ean khi t\'e1i xu\u7845\'3ft ra kh\u7887\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam. Nh\'fdng khi c\'e1c l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af40\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f40\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'fd do \'f0\u7875\'3f mi\u7877\'3fn thu\u7871\'3f nh\u7853\'3f
p kh\u7849\'3fu cho c\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f n\'eau tr\'ean thay \'f0\u7893\'3fi so v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t
\u7841\'3fi H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng (th\'ed d\u7909\'3f:  C\'e1c lo\u7841\'3fi v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd, thi\u7871\'3ft b\u7883\'3f n\'f3i tr\'ean kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng cho c\'e1c ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng d\u7847\'3f
u kh\'ed, kh\'f4ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc t\'e1i xu\u7845\'3ft kh\u7887\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam m\'e0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f t\u7841\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam hay \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \'f0o\u7841\'3ft theo c\'e1ch kh\'e1c) c\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847
\'3fu c\'f3 ngh\u297\'3fa v\u7909\'3f truy n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu.
\par Th\u7911\'3f t\u7909\'3fc truy n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f nh\u7853\'3fp kh\u7849\'3fu th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Ph\'e1p lu\u7853\'3ft hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh.
\par 6) Thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f
\par Nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f tham gia c\'e1c ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft kinh doanh trong ph\u7841\'3fm vi H\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng c\'f3 ngh\u297\'3fa v\u7909\'3f n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f theo c\'e1c quy \'f0
\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Lu\u7853\'3ft ph\'e1p hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh v\u7873\'3f thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f trong l\u297\'3fnh v\u7921\'3fc d\u7847\'3fu kh\'ed.
\par Ri\'eang \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng kh\'f4ng theo c\'e1c h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'ecnh th
\u7913\'3fc }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Lu\u7853\'3ft \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i t\u7841\'3f
i Vi\u7879\'3ft nam kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi  n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c h\u7907\'3fp \'f0\u7891\'3fng m\'e0 c\'e1c c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn 
\u7903\'3f ngo\'e0i Vi\u7879\'3ft nam.
\par B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh u\u7927\'3f quy\u7873\'3fn cho T\u7893\'3fng c\'f4ng ty d\u7847\'3fu m\u7887\'3f v\'e0 kh\'ed \'f0\u7889\'3ft Vi\u7879\'3ft nam thu thu\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f n\'fd\u7899
\'3fc ngo\'e0i n\'eau tr\'ean.
\par T\u7893\'3fng C\'f4ng ty d\u7847\'3fu m\u7887\'3f v\'e0 kh\'ed \'f0\u7889\'3ft Vi\u7879\'3ft nam c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm, quy\u7873\'3fn h\u7841\'3fn v\'e0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\'fd\u7903\'3fng m\u7885\'3fi quy\u7873\'3fn l\u7907\'3fi trong khi t
\u7893\'3f ch\u7913\'3fc thu thu\u7871\'3f nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i nh\'fd c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi thu\u7871\'3f nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu ph\u7909\'3f.
\par 7) Thu\u7871\'3f thu nh\u7853\'3fp c\'e1 nh\'e2n
\par Nh\'e2n vi\'ean l\'e0 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam v\'e0 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc t\u7841\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam cho nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i v\'e0 b\'ean tham gia n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo
\'e0i c\'f3 ngh\u297\'3fa v\u7909\'3f n\u7897\'3fp thu\u7871\'3f thu nh\u7853\'3fp c\'e1 nh\'e2n theo c\'e1c quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa Lu\u7853\'3ft ph\'e1p hi\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh v\u7873\'3f thu\u7871\'3f thu nh\u7853\'3fp c\'e1 nh\'e2n. \'d0
\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi nh\'e2n vi\'ean l\'e0 ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc t\u7841\'3fi Vi\u7879\'3ft nam \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc lo\u7841\'3fi tr\u7915\'3f kh\u7887\'3fi thu nh\u7853\'3fp ch\u7883\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f c\'e1
c kho\u7843\'3fn thu nh\u7853\'3fp kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi ti\u7873\'3fn l\'fd\'f5ng \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc chi tr\u7843\'3f d\'fd\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'ecnh th\u7913\'3f
c  kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi ti\u7873\'3fn t\u7879\'3f (chi ph\'ed v\u7873\'3f nh\'e0 \u7903\'3f, d\u7883\'3fch v\u7909\'3f y t\u7871\'3f v\'e0 c\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn t}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'fd
\'f5ng t\u7921\'3f). Nh\'e0 th\u7847\'3fu v\'e0 b\'ean tham gia n\'fd\u7899\'3fc ngo\'e0i c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm g\u7917\'3fi cho c\'f5 quan thu\u7871\'3f ch\'ednh s\'e1ch \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi nh\'e2n vi\'ean c\u7911\'3fa m}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af42\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f42\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'ecnh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid11361701\charrsid7499905 \'f0\u7875\'3f l\'e0m c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh thu nh\u7853\'3fp ch\u7883
\'3fu thu\u7871\'3f.
