\par C\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn thu cho NSNN theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd n\'e0y \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o ch\'fd\'f5ng 16, lo\u7841\'3fi 01,  kho\u7843\'3fn 02,  h\u7841\'3fng 2 c\u7911\'3fa m\u7909\'3fc l\u7909\'3f
